## Phase 3 — The review loop

The single highest-value fix: the product's core action currently 404s, and this is also what lets you exercise the AI providers from the UI rather than from Swagger.

- **Create `frontend/src/app/businesses/[slug]/review/page.tsx`** — the missing route. `reviews.create` already exists in `lib/api.ts:91` and is called from nowhere.
- **Turn on `ReviewCard`'s actions.** The component already renders like/report buttons and takes `onLike`/`onReport`; both call sites pass `showActions={false}`, so it's dead UI. Backend `/reviews/{id}/like` and `/report` exist and are unused.
- **Merchant replies.** `POST /reviews/{id}/reply` exists; `ReviewCard` never renders `review.reply` at all despite the data being there.
- **Photo upload** on review submission, and fix the gallery: business detail fakes it from `[storefront_url, logo_url]` instead of calling `GET /photos/business/{id}`.

Note the interaction with Phase 1c — this is the path that triggers AI analysis, so degradation behaviour becomes user-visible here.

