## Phase 6 — Admin moderation

`/admin` currently iterates `Object.entries(stats)` into a key-value grid, and **prints hardcoded credentials (`admin@merchanthub.ai / admin12345`) into the UI on error** — remove that regardless of anything else here.

Build the actual queues against endpoints that already exist and have no UI: pending-business approval (`/businesses/{id}/approve`, `/suspend`) and reported-review moderation (`/reviews/{id}/moderate`).

Also: `/merchant/dashboard` and `/admin` have **no client-side route guard** and there is no `middleware.ts`. The backend's `require_roles` is the only real enforcement — fine for security, bad UX (a logged-out user gets a flash of empty admin chrome then an error).

